# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# `/about` was folded into the Business page: the brand story, cooperation
# options and contact panel all live at /business now. A 301 keeps the old
# inbound links and the search ranking pointing at the merged page.

/about /business 301
/about/ /business 301

# The framed scratching board became the woven sisal board; keep old links live.
/products/cat-scratcher-frame /products/woven-sisal-cat-scratcher 301
/products/cat-scratcher-frame/ /products/woven-sisal-cat-scratcher 301

# Google Merchant Center 的「Cart or checkout page URL」是必填的模板，字段校验
# 要求必须带 `{id}`，所以填不出 `/cart`（会报 Missing required parameter: {id}），
# 只能填 `https://meowerair.com/cart/{id}:1`。`{id}` 会替换成 feed 里的 g:id，
# 也就是 Shopify 的 variant id（见 scripts/make-google-feed.mjs）。
#
# 这个路径不是静态文件，构建时也不会被预渲染，所以这里 302 到 Shopify 真正的
# 购物车直链 `<variant_id>:1` —— 那边会继续 302 到 /checkouts/... 结账页，
# Google 跟随重定向后看到的是真实结账页。302 而不是 200 重写：让 URL 变成
# 真正的购物车，而不是一个「空购物车」的静态页。
#
# `/cart`（无 id、精确匹配）不受影响，仍然是预渲染的 cart.html。
/cart/* https://meowerair.myshopify.com/cart/:splat 302
